cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation)."
title: "Inference-audit demo — Quantization-Tolerant Gradient Auditing for Active Inference-Attack Detection in Federated Learning"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained, reproducible demo for a server-side challenge-response audit
  that detects in-band passive membership inference and the active model-mutating
  GAN attack in cross-silo federated learning, without differential-privacy noise.
type: software
